{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f032fd9263dbff5e","name":"Quarren","source":{"id":"source:reference-f032fd9263dbff5e","title":"Quarren","revision":18422,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:06:25Z","sha256":"20028c702cc7b59d20962ef963b35d46cd1599e092c801cdf5fb79e0368ff934","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18422","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Quarren&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f032fd9263dbff5e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Quarren hail from the distant Outer Rim planet of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dac","referenceId":"reference:8654fc7bdc8fd9cb"},", sharing the world with the sentient humanoid ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"},". The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"}," live on the surface of the world, while the more isolationist Quarren dwell in oxygen-filled cities in the deep recesses of the oceans. Offworld, Quarren generally stay clear of galactic politics. Instead, they often become involved with shadowy occupations such as pirates, smugglers, and spy networks. Many Quarren blame both the Empire and the Rebels (even more than the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"},") for their homeworld's devastation during the Galactic Civil War.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Quarren Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," Practical and conservative, Quarren tend to hate change and distrust anyone who displays overt optimism and idealism.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," The average Quarren stands 1.8 meters tall and weigh 72 kilograms. They have leathery skin and heads that resemble four-tentacled squids, hence the name \"Squid Head\" sometimes used by others.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Age Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Age_Groups"},":"]}," Quarren age at the following stages:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHILD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["YOUNG ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MIDDLE AGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["VENERABLE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1-11 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["12-16 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["17- 40 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["41-57 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["58-79 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["80+ Years\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," The watery planet ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dac","referenceId":"reference:8654fc7bdc8fd9cb"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Quarren speak, read, and write Quarrenese and Basic. They tend to also learn Mon Calamarian as well.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," Kelmut, Seggor, Tessek, Tsillin, Vekker, Vuhlg.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," Quarren leave their homeworld to escape their dependency on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mon Calamari"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mon_Calamari","referenceId":"reference:5b784aed2214627b"},". They tend to seek out the fringes of society, operating as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrels"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nobles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nobles"}," in criminal organizations.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Quarren Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Quarren share the following Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," Quarren receive a +2 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"},", but take -2 penalties to both ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"},". Quarren are extremely resilient and physically tough, though they tend toward deficiencies in wisdom and social graces."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," As Medium creatures, Quarren have no special bonuses or penalties due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Quarren have a base speed of 6 squares. They also have a swim speed of 4 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Breathe Underwater:"]}," As amphibious creatures, Quarren can't drown in water."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Conditional Bonus Feat:"]}," Adept traders and negotiators, Quarren with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"}," gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Persuasion)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Persuasion)"}," as a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Expert Swimmer:"]}," A Quarren may choose to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swim","referenceId":"reference:dd4fa375c70c4e42"}," check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse. In addition, a Quarren may choose to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swim","referenceId":"reference:dd4fa375c70c4e42"}," checks, even when distracted or threatened."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Low-Light Vision:"]}," Quarren ignore ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," (but not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"},") from darkness."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Quarren can speak, read, and write both Basic and Quarrenese."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Quarren Species Feats"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Quarren characters have access to the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species_Feats"},". No Species Feats are considered Bonus Feats for any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SPECIES FEAT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["BENEFITS\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Clawed Subspecies"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clawed_Subspecies","referenceId":"reference:9609836ccbfc2e40"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Deal damage with sharp claws on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," attacks.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deep Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deep_Sight","referenceId":"reference:870cf32e5d049137"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gain Darkvision and ignore ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"}," from darkness.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Shrewd Bargainer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shrewd_Bargainer","referenceId":"reference:b5abbe7a48b70c30"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Suppress opponents' insight and morale bonuses to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},".\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
